{"3063720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monster Chef", "steam_appid": 3063720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/5149b9a8f90daea0e8456cf54ccd07af.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/5149b9a8f90daea0e8456cf54ccd07af.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Pranzo, a tiny chef-warrior who fights and cooks monsters using their Chef Weapons. In this action RPG with roguelite and management elements, hunt and cook monsters by day, then manage your Inn by night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Reputation Points, befriend your Allies, and uncover all the secrets of Delizia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn monsters into delicious dishes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f809e8aa525dba7489fb5256407bedf0.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f809e8aa525dba7489fb5256407bedf0.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Monster Chef knows how to use their Chef Weapons to cook tasty recipes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you’ll choose a Daily Menu to complete by preparing specific dishes. Venture into the lands of Delizia in search of Monsters to cook, but don’t let their cute looks fool you: they’re fearsome, fierce, and ready to do anything to avoid ending up in the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once their Cooking Resistance is depleted, throw a Pot at them and the dish is served! The final hit will determine the final Recipe, so make sure you don’t miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Humble Shack to Legendary Inn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/d1f8e3c13b8458883e2749e0f2afe7d1.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/d1f8e3c13b8458883e2749e0f2afe7d1.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Daily Menu is complete, return to your Inn to serve customers from all across Delizia: elves, orcs, merfolk, and humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As any respectable Monster Chef apprentice, you have been gifted an Inn, but not just any Inn: you’ll be taking care of the one that once belonged to the greatest Monster Chef of all time, Cibo Cibo Cibo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster Chef Order is counting on you to restore this run-down place to its former glory. Earn Reputation Points, find Allies who can help you manage it, and who knows? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you might finally prepare a lavish banquet for the Kings and Queens of Delizia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Colorful Hand-Drawn World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f31490d0fe574fdbc60701e8d1abfd68.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f31490d0fe574fdbc60701e8d1abfd68.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever-changing lands of Delizia, an open world with a procedurally generated map where each day brings a new adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you hunt monsters, you’ll come across ancient ruins and mysterious objects that reveal the history of Delizia. Will you uncover its secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise through the ranks of the ancient Monster Chef Order</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/477bf9e011169afc8cbdd8ff33d554fa.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/477bf9e011169afc8cbdd8ff33d554fa.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress the members of the ancient Monster Chef Order by preparing lavish banquets from the giant bosses you defeat. Unlock new biomes, each filled with different monsters and challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a varied cast of Allies, each with their own story and unique personality. Build friendships, lend a hand whenever you can, and uncover hidden secrets through exclusive dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/818910a408e85e4fba7cdfaa24d788d8.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/818910a408e85e4fba7cdfaa24d788d8.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/5149b9a8f90daea0e8456cf54ccd07af.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/5149b9a8f90daea0e8456cf54ccd07af.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Pranzo, a tiny chef-warrior who fights and cooks monsters using their Chef Weapons. In this action RPG with roguelite and management elements, hunt and cook monsters by day, then manage your Inn by night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Reputation Points, befriend your Allies, and uncover all the secrets of Delizia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn monsters into delicious dishes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f809e8aa525dba7489fb5256407bedf0.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f809e8aa525dba7489fb5256407bedf0.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Monster Chef knows how to use their Chef Weapons to cook tasty recipes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you’ll choose a Daily Menu to complete by preparing specific dishes. Venture into the lands of Delizia in search of Monsters to cook, but don’t let their cute looks fool you: they’re fearsome, fierce, and ready to do anything to avoid ending up in the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once their Cooking Resistance is depleted, throw a Pot at them and the dish is served! The final hit will determine the final Recipe, so make sure you don’t miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Humble Shack to Legendary Inn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/d1f8e3c13b8458883e2749e0f2afe7d1.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/d1f8e3c13b8458883e2749e0f2afe7d1.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Daily Menu is complete, return to your Inn to serve customers from all across Delizia: elves, orcs, merfolk, and humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As any respectable Monster Chef apprentice, you have been gifted an Inn, but not just any Inn: you’ll be taking care of the one that once belonged to the greatest Monster Chef of all time, Cibo Cibo Cibo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster Chef Order is counting on you to restore this run-down place to its former glory. Earn Reputation Points, find Allies who can help you manage it, and who knows? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you might finally prepare a lavish banquet for the Kings and Queens of Delizia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Colorful Hand-Drawn World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f31490d0fe574fdbc60701e8d1abfd68.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f31490d0fe574fdbc60701e8d1abfd68.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever-changing lands of Delizia, an open world with a procedurally generated map where each day brings a new adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you hunt monsters, you’ll come across ancient ruins and mysterious objects that reveal the history of Delizia. Will you uncover its secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise through the ranks of the ancient Monster Chef Order</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/477bf9e011169afc8cbdd8ff33d554fa.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/477bf9e011169afc8cbdd8ff33d554fa.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress the members of the ancient Monster Chef Order by preparing lavish banquets from the giant bosses you defeat. Unlock new biomes, each filled with different monsters and challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a varied cast of Allies, each with their own story and unique personality. Build friendships, lend a hand whenever you can, and uncover hidden secrets through exclusive dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/818910a408e85e4fba7cdfaa24d788d8.poster.avif?t=1782924850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/818910a408e85e4fba7cdfaa24d788d8.webm?t=1782924850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "FIGHT! COOK! SERVE! Play as Pranzo, a tiny chef-warrior who cooks monsters right on the battlefield. In this action RPG, explore the world of Delizia, grow your inn’s reputation, serve picky customers, and rise through the ranks of the ancient Monster Chef Order as you uncover its secrets.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/231cc4e19c0b98bdfe10a316dae2092a388b3d10/header.jpg?t=1782924850", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/f2102b69c61dd895c96f315d23c34a605a8f95b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782924850", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/f2102b69c61dd895c96f315d23c34a605a8f95b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782924850", "website": "https://www.studiopizza.net/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240 (2 * 3400) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1024 MB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not compatible with VR devices</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 (4 * 3200) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 (2048 MB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not compatible with VR devices</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240 (2 * 3400) or equivalent, or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 530 or equivalent or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 (4 * 3200) or equivalent, or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon R9 M290X or equivalent, or Apple M1 integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></